# Straight 16ths with a slightly late-feeling pocket. X=accent, x=hit, g=ghost, .=rest.
title "Porchlight Pocket"
tempo 94
meter 4/4
resolution 16
bars 8
swing 0.54
seed 1977

track kick  | X... ..x. .... x... | X... .... ..x. x... | ; gain=0.78 humanize_ms=5
