track hat   | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.xo x.x. xxx. | ; gain=0.22 pan=0.18 humanize_ms=4
track clap  | .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x... | ; gain=0.18 pan=-0.22 humanize_ms=10
